    "intro_narrative": "The world you once knew is buried under radioactive dust and twisted metal. As a scavenger exploring the ruins of Sector 7, you've stumbled upon an abandoned underground military bunker. The air is thick with the smell of ozone and decay. Emergency lights flicker weakly, illuminating ancient terminals and rusted lockboxes scattered throughout the facility. Your objective is clear: navigate through this forgotten labyrinth, bypass the degraded security systems, and extract the legendary final data drive. Survival outside depends on the secrets hidden deep within this bunker. Be careful, as every terminal and safe is interconnected through a complex web of obsolete technology.",
